-- Matched dive-ending/bonus build required; existing spell mechanics stay intact.
UPDATE `spell_dbc` SET `Description_Lang_enUS` = 'Draw your weapon and leap to an enemy within 25 yards, dealing Holy impact damage and slowing nearby enemies by 30% for 3 seconds. While hovering, dive instead for 20% more impact damage; Hover ends after the dive. Interrupted dives end Hover safely, and its cooldown starts on landing. The impact creates a 5-yard Consecration for 3 seconds, dealing Holy damage each second. Damage scales with your higher attack power or spell power. 2-minute cooldown.', `AuraDescription_Lang_enUS` = 'Draw your weapon and leap to an enemy within 25 yards, dealing Holy impact damage and slowing nearby enemies by 30% for 3 seconds. While hovering, dive instead for 20% more impact damage; Hover ends after the dive. Interrupted dives end Hover safely, and its cooldown starts on landing. The impact creates a 5-yard Consecration for 3 seconds, dealing Holy damage each second. Damage scales with your higher attack power or spell power. 2-minute cooldown.' WHERE `ID` = 111110;
